# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2018 Redox OS
#
# The hooks for the `azos` platform (userspace/lib/relibc-azos/overlay).
#
# target_os = "azos" takes the Linux flavour of every constant and layout that the
# Linux platform shares with the header modules (errno, open flags, mman, termios,
# signal numbers): the native ABI keeps Linux values for them (azos_abi::error), and
# the Linux personality runs the same programs. Syscall use stays Linux-only. The rest
# selects the azos platform module, its startup and TLS activation, the libsys
# dependency, and a 128 KiB default thread stack (the kernel charges mapped pages).
#
